[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0143","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0143.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0159","title":"HP HP-UX 权限提升漏洞","description":"HP Ignite-UX 是 HP-UX 操作系统中的系统镜像创建工具，其在创建可信系统镜像时未能正确保存 /etc/passwd 文件中的用户密码哈希字段，导致生成的镜像中用户密码字段被置空。本地攻击者登录系统后可通过空密码直接访问任意用户账户，从而获得系统最高权限。该漏洞影响 HP-UX 操作系统，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0159"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-17","updated":"2000-02-17","remediation":"安装 HP 提供的 Ignite-UX 安全补丁（如 PHCO_20153 等对应版本补丁）。使用 Ignite-UX 创建系统映像前，手动备份 /etc/passwd 和 /etc/shadow 文件；恢复系统后立即执行 pwconv 同步口令数据库，并使用 passwd 命令为所有用户（尤其是 root）重设口令，确认 /etc/passwd 中口令字段非空。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f619ecf484fdb11d96af754b241cfa934df131f9/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0159.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0159","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0159.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df56f4cca3ff4a807de70444fbb8d3458b1d46ca/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0159.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/ca4032f687e5627fcf86913a0441b18137902527/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-4hjr-mh66-rpm7/GHSA-4hjr-mh66-rpm7.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0159.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/d49ed792663c6bbe758cf7f56c6f7fd7c4afcbb1/2000.tsv","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_gainpre.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0143.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0142","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0142.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0158","title":"SCO OpenServer MMDF 缓冲区溢出权限提升漏洞","description":"MMDF 邮件服务器在处理 SMTP 协议的 MAIL FROM 命令时存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可向目标服务器的 25 端口发送超长 MAIL FROM 命令，触发栈缓冲区溢出，从而覆盖返回地址实现任意代码执行，进而获取服务器最高权限。该漏洞影响 SCO OpenServer 等使用 MMDF 邮件系统的操作系统，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0158"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-16T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:07.263","remediation":"建议升级 SCO OpenServer 至 5.0.5 或更高版本，并安装 MMDF 相关安全补丁。如无法升级，可在 inetd.conf 中注释 SMTP 服务或配置防火墙限制 25 端口访问，同时限制 SMTP 后台程序的 MAIL FROM 命令长度作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/997","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&date=2000-02-15&msg=000001bf78af%246d0d47a0%244d2f45a1%40jmagdych.na.nai.com","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&date=2000-02-15&msg=200002181449.JAA03436%40dragonfly.corp.home.net","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3707ef32edab409db4eb6f5766397ecef95f7e15/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0158.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0158","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0158.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df56f4cca3ff4a807de70444fbb8d3458b1d46ca/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0158.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/ca4032f687e5627fcf86913a0441b18137902527/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-37h5-v582-hp97/GHSA-37h5-v582-hp97.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x1000/997/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152200_152300.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0158.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--ec509196-fbc1-4eec-ba5a-a881a3326576.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/NVDFeatureAnalysis/blob/493a57a415cc110f9945148abd717eeb92f6ca7e/originalDataset/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0142.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0140","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0140.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0156","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 安全域绕过漏洞","description":"Internet Explorer 4.x 及 5.x 版本存在跨域文件访问漏洞（Image Source Redirect）。当 Web 服务器将浏览器窗口从一个域导航到另一个域时，IE 安全模型会检查服务器对新页面的权限。但攻击者可以构造恶意网页，将浏览器窗口打开到客户端本地文件，再将该窗口导航回攻击者所属域，使得本地文件内容在极短时间内对新窗口可访问。攻击者只需知道或猜测文件名及路径，即可读取目标计算机上可在浏览器窗口中打开的任意类型文件，但无法添加、修改或删除文件。该漏洞影响 Internet Explorer 4.0、4.01、5.0 及 5.01 版本，Microsoft 已于 2000 年 2 月发布安全公告 MS00-009 提供修复补丁。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0156"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-16T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:07.020","remediation":"安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS00-009 对应补丁，可通过 Windows Update 获取更新。IE 4.01 SP1 及更早版本需升级至 IE 5.01 以上版本后再安装补丁。鉴于 Internet Explorer 已停止技术支持，建议彻底迁移至 Microsoft Edge 或 Chrome 等现代浏览器以根除风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/7827","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-009","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/3996","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19719","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3707ef32edab409db4eb6f5766397ecef95f7e15/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0156.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0156","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0156.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df56f4cca3ff4a807de70444fbb8d3458b1d46ca/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0156.json","https://github.com/biggerwing/nsfocus-rsas-knowledge-base/blob/156208b301d4649ead13cd15f827830d08245b89/example","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/ca4032f687e5627fcf86913a0441b18137902527/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-6rhq-4pc8-424f/GHSA-6rhq-4pc8-424f.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0156.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152100_152200.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001173.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--5c0fb57d-4fb8-422c-91cf-624cc237111c.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0140.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0140.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0140.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0138","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0138.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0154","title":"SCO UnixWare ARCserver 本地符号链接漏洞","description":"SCO UnixWare 7.1/7.1.1 中 ARCserver 组件在处理 /tmp 临时文件时未进行符号链接安全检查，本地攻击者可通过在 /tmp 目录创建恶意符号链接，诱使 ARCserver 进程以高权限向攻击者指定的任意文件写入数据，从而实现对敏感文件的非授权修改。该漏洞要求攻击者拥有本地访问权限，利用难度较低，影响 ARCserver 所管理的所有备份与恢复任务。","severity":"LOW","score":1.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0154"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-16T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:06.770","remediation":"立即升级至 SCO Unixware 7.1.1 及 ARCserve 5.0 或更高版本，使用最新的安全补丁。配置 ARCserve 强制指定安全目录而不使用 /tmp，并启用对临时文件的完整性验证。降低用户权限，避免使用 root 用户操作。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.sco.com/security/","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/988","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&date=2000-02-15&msg=000101bf78af%2494528870%244d2f45a1%40jmagdych.na.nai.com","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3707ef32edab409db4eb6f5766397ecef95f7e15/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0154.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0154","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0154.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df56f4cca3ff4a807de70444fbb8d3458b1d46ca/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0154.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/ca4032f687e5627fcf86913a0441b18137902527/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-6mjj-5236-h5mx/GHSA-6mjj-5236-h5mx.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0154.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152100_152200.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001172.txt","https://github.com/williamjsmail/piranha/blob/e60f12e6edcde8585ee473f701c2421f6efe72d9/CVE2CAPEC/database/CVE-2000.jsonl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0138.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0078","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0078.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0094","title":"FreeBSD/NetBSD/OpenBSD /proc 文件系统本地权限提升漏洞","description":"FreeBSD 3.4、NetBSD 1.4.1 及 OpenBSD 2.6 等 BSD 系统的 /proc 文件系统存在本地权限提升漏洞。本地攻击者可通过修改 stderr 的文件描述符，利用 /proc/pid/mem 接口写入进程内存，从而以 root 权限执行任意代码。该漏洞需要攻击者拥有本地 shell 访问权限，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。受影响版本包括 FreeBSD 3.4、NetBSD 1.4.1 及 OpenBSD 2.6。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0094"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-02-16T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:59.290","remediation":"建议升级到修复版本：FreeBSD 升级至 3.5 及以上，OpenBSD 升级至 2.7 及以上，NetBSD 升级至 1.5 及以上。如无法升级，卸载 procfs 文件系统（umount /proc）或修改 /etc/fstab 禁止自动挂载 procfs；若必须使用，在挂载选项中添加 -o nosuid 限制提权路径。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/20760","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/940","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/3995","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19726","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4e452a37e644e8194f1171b7eec1f7dc625b6526/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0094.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d880529b2028116bddf6c732baf8f599b169f01e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0094.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0094","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0094.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0094.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/64de4f2cd86a1126b3a6d15ba07e17a7857c3906/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-00xx/CVE-2000-0094.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/1112c06e8b32d57dcace0dcdcf6de65ca1ded7e3/2000/CVE-2000-0094.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0094.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0094.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0094.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0078.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0078.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0078.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0686","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0686.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0222","title":"Microsoft Windows 2000 ADMIN$共享未授权访问漏洞","description":"Windows 2000 在安装过程中直至系统首次重启前不会激活 Administrator 账户密码，导致远程攻击者可在无需认证的情况下通过 SMB 协议连接至 ADMIN$ 隐藏共享，获取系统完全控制权限。该漏洞影响 Windows 2000 所有版本，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。攻击者只需知道目标 IP 地址即可在安装后的重启间隙利用空密码直接访问管理共享，进行恶意操作。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0222"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-15T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:15.520","remediation":"Windows 2000 安装完成后立即重启系统以激活管理员密码，重启前勿将系统接入网络。如无法立即重启，可先通过本地安全策略设置管理员密码，并禁用 ADMIN$ 默认共享（net share ADMIN$ /delete）。安装 Windows 2000 Service Pack 1 或更高版本可彻底修复此问题。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/990","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=20000215155750.M4500%40safe.hsc.fr","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/837e8232e5e0f859088f714711fc711909aefe8c/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0222.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0222","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/ffa50060b7ba6ae58d60d6d90533e77eaf10d466/2000/CVE-2000-0222/README.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0222.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/9c3559b25784ca21f930998243369aaa64d45e45/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0222.json","https://github.com/Azure/Azure-Sentinel/blob/5d7fb6cfb828397f44669aa46e3f9a478b5dbc99/Sample%20Data/Custom/beSECURE_ScanResults_CL.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/a96652a2a06e880f217d1d6526622d8501dbbd69/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-vg3x-6jxc-mj3p/GHSA-vg3x-6jxc-mj3p.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/S/smb_blank_admin_password.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/smb_login.nasl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0686.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0199","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0199.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0224","title":"SCO UnixWare ARCserver 本地符号链接漏洞","description":"SCO UnixWare 7.1 及 7.1.1 版本中的 ARCserver 组件在处理 /tmp 临时文件时存在符号链接漏洞。本地攻击者可通过创建恶意符号链接指向系统关键文件，当 ARCserver 以 root 权限写入临时文件时，将覆盖或篡改目标文件，从而实现权限提升获取 root 控制权限。该漏洞利用条件为拥有本地访问权限，攻击复杂度低。","severity":"LOW","score":1.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0224"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-15T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:15.793","remediation":"移除 ARCserve agent 的 setuid/setgid 权限位以防止本地提权；限制系统仅授权可信用户登录。由于 SCO UnixWare 7.x 已停止技术支持且无官方补丁，建议迁移至现代受支持的操作系统与备份解决方案（如 Amanda、Bacula）作为彻底修复措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&date=2000-02-15&msg=000101bf78af%2494528870%244d2f45a1%40jmagdych.na.nai.com","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19752","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/837e8232e5e0f859088f714711fc711909aefe8c/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0224.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0224","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0224.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8575b52c5f0d68ec89781aae82e849b4f469cd84/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0224.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/a96652a2a06e880f217d1d6526622d8501dbbd69/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-88qx-39r7-wq45/GHSA-88qx-39r7-wq45.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88294/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0224.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_0.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--5a4dcab7-6803-401a-8eb5-0506de4c5125.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0199.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0199.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0199.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0147","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0147.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0167","title":"Microsoft IIS 4.0 Pickup 目录拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Microsoft IIS 4.0 的 Pickup 目录存在拒绝服务漏洞，本地攻击者通过在该目录下创建文件名超长且扩展名为 .txt.eml 的邮件文件，可触发 Inetinfo.exe 进程崩溃，导致 IIS 邮件服务不可用。该漏洞影响 IIS 4.0 版本，利用条件为攻击者需具备本地文件写入权限，CVSS 评分 2.1，危害等级低，属于本地拒绝服务漏洞。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0167"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-15T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:08.410","remediation":"该漏洞影响已停止支持的 Microsoft IIS 4.0（Windows NT 4.0 Option Pack），微软未发布针对此版本的安全更新。建议升级至 Windows Server 2003 及以上版本的 IIS 6.0 或更高版本；如无法升级，可通过 NTFS 权限限制本地用户对 %SystemRoot%\\System32\\Inetsrv\\mailroot\\Pickup 目录的写入权限，并启用文件名字长检查作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.ntbugtraq.com/default.asp?pid=36&sid=1&A2=ind0002&L=ntbugtraq&F=&S=&P=8800","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20310","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9b149e946381b5dfe67f5c76cee65997e05f3a01/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0167.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0167","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0167.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/b8e6f3ed799539d1c038cf82ae94c10d35c39858/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0167.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/ca4032f687e5627fcf86913a0441b18137902527/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-gmg7-xp25-93hp/GHSA-gmg7-xp25-93hp.json","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/invicti/vulnerabilities/db/vulnerabilities/vdb/2000/0xxx/cve-2000-0167.yaml","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0167.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--26d80389-5595-4b40-929f-5170b708523e.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001168.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0147.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0174","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0174.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0197","title":"Microsoft Windows NT 计划任务权限提升漏洞","description":"Windows NT 的计划任务调度器（Task Scheduler）在执行批处理文件时，会使用当前登录交互用户的驱动器映射而非系统账户的映射，导致本地低权限用户可通过将恶意批处理文件替换原始计划任务中的批处理文件，诱使系统以更高权限执行恶意代码，从而获取权限提升。该漏洞影响 Windows NT 4.0 系统，攻击者须具备本地登录权限，CVSS 评分 4.6，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0197"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-14T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:12.237","remediation":"立即安装 Windows NT 4.0 Service Pack 6a（最高版本服务包），该补丁已修复任务计划程序使用交互用户驱动器映射的问题。由于 Windows NT 4.0 已停止支持，建议升级至受支持的 Windows Server 版本（如 Windows Server 2019/2022）。临时缓解措施：限制可执行 AT 命令的用户权限，仅授权管理员账户使用计划任务功能。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/ntbugtraq/current/0202.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1050","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0197.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0197","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0197.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/09ea4c6e198f67c97f9e843f2fc9dbea00a9ec98/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0197.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/60cf806ffc57d6909f887b4f3823ae39ed0d7c51/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-987q-p2gc-f52w/GHSA-987q-p2gc-f52w.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0197.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152200_152300.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/80642f827c3cd89c2fb8893d0e3fe04ead516ea4/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0174.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0134","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0134.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0150","title":"Check Point Firewall-1 FTP 端口访问限制绕过漏洞","description":"Check Point Firewall-1 存在安全绕过漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向 FTP 服务器发送恶意构造的数据包，诱使服务器返回被 Firewall-1 误判为合法的 227 响应（用于 PASV 被动模式端口协商），从而绕过防火墙的端口访问限制策略，实现对受保护内部网络的非授权访问。该漏洞影响 Check Point Firewall-1 系列产品，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。攻击者可在无需认证的情况下远程利用，建议升级至厂商修复版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0150"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-12T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:06.277","remediation":"升级 Check Point Firewall-1 至 4.1 SP2 或 NG FP1 及以上版本（厂商已于 2000 年 2 月发布修复补丁）。如无法立即升级，可临时禁用防火墙的 FTP 应用层状态检测功能，或限制来自非信任网络的匿名 FTP 访问，同时确保 FTP 服务器不回显用户输入的命令参数到控制通道响应中。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/328867","http://www.osvdb.org/4417","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/979","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6acfb9cecc7e37f5bf14164f693abec3417aeb06/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0150.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0150","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0150.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df56f4cca3ff4a807de70444fbb8d3458b1d46ca/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0150.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/ca4032f687e5627fcf86913a0441b18137902527/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-pjp8-g7wh-3846/GHSA-pjp8-g7wh-3846.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0150.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--e6b37487-b863-4fe6-a16d-f14a8db9b7b8.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001166.txt","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idbypass"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0134.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0408","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0408.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0141","title":"Infopop Ultimate Bulletin Board 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Infopop Ultimate Bulletin Board（UBB）论坛系统中存在命令注入漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可在发表主题时通过隐藏字段（topic hidden field）注入shell元字符，成功利用可导致服务器端任意命令执行，完全控制目标系统。该漏洞影响UBB全版本，CVSS评分10.0，危害等级严重。建议立即升级至不受影响版本。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0141"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-11T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:05.100","remediation":"升级至 Ultimate Bulletin Board 5.14 或更高版本，该版本已对 topic 隐藏表单字段进行 shell 元字符过滤。手动缓解措施：编辑 UBB CGI 脚本，在将所有用户输入（尤其是 topic 字段）传递给 system/popen 等调用之前，过滤掉 | ; ` $ ( ) 等 shell 特殊字符。UBB 已于 2000 年代停止维护，建议迁移至现代活跃维护的论坛系统。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/991","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&date=2000-02-22&msg=NDBBLKOPOLNKELHPDEFKIEPGCAAA.renzo.toma%40veronica.nl","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&date=2000-02-8&msg=20000211224935.A13236%40infomag.ape.relarn.ru","http://www.ultimatebb.com/home/versions.shtml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/fe843ab2b4a415ff4c1b33508a5c7bbbe8d1116c/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0141.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0141","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/ffa50060b7ba6ae58d60d6d90533e77eaf10d466/2000/CVE-2000-0141/README.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0141.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/be9b320c2a949cb73c32157503bdf6fad99f369e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0141.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/ca4032f687e5627fcf86913a0441b18137902527/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-g2jv-69ph-8q7w/GHSA-g2jv-69ph-8q7w.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152100_152200.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0141.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001163.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0408.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0408.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0408.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0127","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0127.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0143","title":"SSH sshd 本地 TCP 连接重定向漏洞","description":"SSH协议守护进程sshd存在安全漏洞，本地无shell访问权限的用户可利用该漏洞将TCP连接重定向至使用标准系统密码数据库进行认证的服务（如POP、FTP），导致未授权访问。攻击者需具备本地账户权限，利用sshd的端口转发功能绕过访问控制，实现认证绕过与权限提升。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0143"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-11T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:05.360","remediation":"升级 SSH 服务器至 1.2.31 或更高版本（官方补丁已修复 TCP 连接重定向漏洞），或迁移至 OpenSSH（不受此漏洞影响）。作为临时缓解措施，可在 /etc/ssh/sshd_config 中设置 PermitEmptyPasswords no 并限制可登录用户列表。由于该漏洞年代久远，强烈建议升级到当前仍受支持的 OpenSSH 版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-2000-0143","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2000/CVE-2000-0143.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f655f864c18bd25e1fca21f5741c644854233bf0/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0143.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0143","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/a497230c8287cbc5af55c24417f0c800d1a3fae1/2000/CVE-2000-0143.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0143.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/ca4032f687e5627fcf86913a0441b18137902527/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-mcq5-ghfg-w6qg/GHSA-mcq5-ghfg-w6qg.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/be9b320c2a949cb73c32157503bdf6fad99f369e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0143.json","https://github.com/djc/oxish/blob/bf64cf02d5e31a17e708d69e2e0f66422499f851/openssh-vulnerabilities.md","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88337/info.html","https://github.com/Freem93/grammar_nasl_v2/blob/63834ebb8cd6e97050e155291c7500ad53bb20c6/plugins/openssh_122.nasl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0127.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0126","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0126.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0142","title":"Netopia Timbuktu Pro 认证拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Netopia Timbuktu Pro 远程控制软件 2.0b650 及 5.2.1 版本的认证协议存在安全缺陷，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向目标主机的 407 和 1417 端口发送大量连接请求，消耗服务器资源，导致目标系统服务响应缓慢甚至完全崩溃，形成拒绝服务条件。该漏洞影响 Netopia Timbuktu Pro 2.0b650 及 5.2.1 版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0142"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-11T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:05.240","remediation":"建议升级 Timbuktu Pro 至 2.0b650 之后的版本，或在防火墙/主机层面限制对端口 407 和 1417 的访问，仅允许受信任 IP 连接。如产品已停止支持，建议迁移至其他受支持的远程控制软件以彻底消除风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-2000-0142","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19750","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2000/CVE-2000-0142.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/fe843ab2b4a415ff4c1b33508a5c7bbbe8d1116c/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0142.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0142","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/a497230c8287cbc5af55c24417f0c800d1a3fae1/2000/CVE-2000-0142.json","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/115c94bd1da3cc18977d652d6e78c9f4a5dfc13b/data/year/2000.txt","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/ca4032f687e5627fcf86913a0441b18137902527/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-58hp-w4jf-r5x7/GHSA-58hp-w4jf-r5x7.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/be9b320c2a949cb73c32157503bdf6fad99f369e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0142.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x1000/984/info.html","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001164.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0126.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0125","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0125.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0140","title":"True North Internet Anywhere Mail Server POP3 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"True North Internet Anywhere Mail Server 3.1.3 版本的 POP3 服务存在拒绝服务漏洞，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标服务器发送大量并发连接请求，耗尽服务器连接资源池，导致 POP3 服务崩溃或无法响应正常请求，影响邮件服务的正常可用性。该漏洞影响 Internet Anywhere Mail Server 3.1.3 版本，无需特殊权限即可远程触发，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0140"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-10T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:04.987","remediation":"该漏洞极旧，厂商 True North Software 已停止维护该产品。建议措施：1) 升级到 Internet Anywhere Mail Server 3.3 及以上版本（若仍可获得）；2) 在服务器端 SMTP/POP3 服务中配置最大并发连接数限制（如 MaxConnections=100）；3) 在防火墙层面限制对 POP3 端口（110/TCP）的源 IP 连接速率，防止单一来源大量连接耗尽服务资源；4) 长期建议迁移至仍受支持的现代邮件服务器（如 Dovecot + Postfix）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=95021326417936&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/980","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/fe843ab2b4a415ff4c1b33508a5c7bbbe8d1116c/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0140.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0140","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0140.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/be9b320c2a949cb73c32157503bdf6fad99f369e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0140.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/ca4032f687e5627fcf86913a0441b18137902527/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-rhrc-cc2w-crx2/GHSA-rhrc-cc2w-crx2.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0140.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152100_152200.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001162.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/3e910c6d0fff2c3163dd69b92eb626a214df8855/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0125.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0409","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0409.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0148","title":"MySQL MySQL 3.22 密码认证绕过漏洞","description":"MySQL 3.22 及之前版本存在身份认证绕过漏洞，远程攻击者无需有效凭证即可通过向 MySQL 服务发送特制的短校验字符串绕过密码验证，直接访问目标数据库。该漏洞源于 MySQL 对认证数据包校验长度的处理缺陷，攻击者利用此漏洞可获取数据库的未授权访问权限，导致敏感数据泄露或数据篡改。该漏洞影响所有 MySQL 3.22 系列版本，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0148"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-08T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:06.007","remediation":"升级 MySQL 至 3.23 及以上版本，该漏洞已在 3.23.x 系列中修复；对于仍在运行的遗留系统，建议升级至当前仍受支持的 MySQL 5.7 或 8.0 版本。如无法升级，可在 my.cnf 中设置 `old_passwords=1` 并限制数据库远程访问来源 IP。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-02/0053.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/975","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f655f864c18bd25e1fca21f5741c644854233bf0/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0148.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0148","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0148.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/be9b320c2a949cb73c32157503bdf6fad99f369e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0148.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/ca4032f687e5627fcf86913a0441b18137902527/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-mrff-5fq9-xcxc/GHSA-mrff-5fq9-xcxc.json","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/acunetix/vulnerabilities/vdb/2000/0xxx/cve-2000-0148.yaml","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/M/mysql_bad_password.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b6